WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:05.990
"Two years ago...

00:02.000 --> 00:05.990
Nil Kamui \ Shuka outskirts"

00:07.440 --> 00:10.770
I'm sorry, but this is all I have right now.

00:10.770 --> 00:13.440
Thank you...

00:13.440 --> 00:16.280
But I can't repay you.

00:18.180 --> 00:21.420
Eykha, you're strong, right?

00:21.420 --> 00:25.720
If so, please join me in protecting my friend.

00:25.720 --> 00:28.420
Me...? Protect...?

00:32.430 --> 00:37.420
I don't think I can protect Ibuki by myself.

00:41.040 --> 00:43.970
Fine, it's a promise.

00:43.970 --> 00:46.610
Thank you, Eykha...

00:46.610 --> 00:49.140
The name of our country is Nil Kamui.

00:49.140 --> 00:51.250
It's a small island country.

00:51.250 --> 00:56.380
Three years have passed since this country fell to the great country Kouran.

00:56.380 --> 01:02.160
Our ally, D'natia, kept its distance, and our guardian deity, Red Dragon, went mad.

01:02.160 --> 01:07.430
I lost everything in this war, called the Seven Year War...

01:07.430 --> 01:13.270
Our castle that ruled over the country, my parents, and my sister Inori...

01:13.270 --> 01:16.070
Imperial Era 3015, October...

01:16.070 --> 01:20.240
We still can't regain control of Nil Kamui.

01:20.240 --> 01:25.010
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

01:25.010 --> 01:29.450
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

01:29.450 --> 01:31.580
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

01:42.360 --> 01:51.710
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

01:51.710 --> 01:52.710
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

01:52.710 --> 01:54.810
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

01:54.810 --> 01:57.880
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

01:57.880 --> 02:00.120
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:00.120 --> 02:02.320
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:02.320 --> 02:06.550
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

02:06.550 --> 02:12.790
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

02:12.790 --> 02:18.300
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

02:18.300 --> 02:23.370
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

02:23.370 --> 02:29.040
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

02:29.040 --> 02:34.650
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

02:34.650 --> 02:38.690
<i>The ending world</i>

02:38.690 --> 02:43.560
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

02:53.870 --> 02:57.510
Didn't all your family members die, Ibuki?

02:57.510 --> 03:01.940
I was the only survivor when the castle fell.

03:01.940 --> 03:05.250
Or that's what I thought...

03:05.250 --> 03:09.220
In any case, you'll need to meet her firsthand.

03:09.220 --> 03:10.740
Lou!

03:12.190 --> 03:14.790
I am a member of the expedition.

03:14.790 --> 03:17.060
I won't die because of this...

03:17.060 --> 03:18.890
We need to get you treated, now!

03:21.230 --> 03:23.930
"D'natia territory \ Fort Rosweisse"

03:34.640 --> 03:36.310
Ogani Volcano erupted?!

03:36.310 --> 03:39.450
But there were no signs of activity during the investigation...

03:39.450 --> 03:44.420
This isn't good... If this keeps up, the fort is going to be in danger.

03:44.420 --> 03:45.910
Open the gate!

03:54.760 --> 03:56.500
Um, that's...?

03:56.500 --> 03:58.330
You can't be serious?

03:58.330 --> 04:00.670
That's the leader of the third corps, Lord Simeon.

04:00.670 --> 04:04.230
O-Of course I remember!
I'm confident in my memory...

04:13.280 --> 04:15.480
Contract seal, release!

04:41.980 --> 04:44.550
He averted the lava flow!

04:44.550 --> 04:46.880
Lord Simeon is a powerful one indeed.

04:46.880 --> 04:48.680
Unbelievable...

04:52.320 --> 04:58.780
The power granted by Black Dragon should be more than halved here on this island...

05:11.570 --> 05:15.010
"Haiga \ Main gate area"

05:15.310 --> 05:16.900
Dear brother!

05:18.510 --> 05:20.820
Thank goodness!

05:20.820 --> 05:23.310
I-Inori...?

05:24.320 --> 05:26.150
I missed you!

05:26.150 --> 05:28.990
Well, now, I don't do well in these situations.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.160
I know that...

05:30.160 --> 05:31.920
Meryl, are you crying?

05:33.330 --> 05:34.730
No, I'm not!

05:34.730 --> 05:37.700
It's really you, Inori...

05:37.700 --> 05:39.530
Why, yes...!

05:39.530 --> 05:42.940
That's right, dear brother!
I wanted to present someone to you.

05:50.010 --> 05:51.500
Ibuki...

05:54.380 --> 05:56.720
Mashiro...?

05:56.720 --> 05:58.690
I met her at Shuka.

05:58.690 --> 06:02.920
I wanted to bring her to you as soon as possible, dear brother.

06:04.630 --> 06:06.290
Wasn't she...?

06:10.700 --> 06:12.360
Mashiro?

06:14.970 --> 06:17.070
Mashiro?!

06:17.070 --> 06:18.700
Mashiro...

06:21.080 --> 06:23.540
"Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

06:23.980 --> 06:26.050
Mashiro died.

06:26.050 --> 06:28.410
I also heard that Inori died.

06:29.420 --> 06:32.950
But Lady Inori was alive.

06:32.950 --> 06:36.390
By order of Agito, I was the one who brought Lady Inori here.

06:36.390 --> 06:39.920
So, Agito was sheltering her all along?

06:41.560 --> 06:43.230
They're still inside!

06:43.230 --> 06:45.500
Your father and family are already...!

06:45.500 --> 06:48.000
Kouran's army is closing in!

06:48.000 --> 06:49.100
Now hurry!

06:49.100 --> 06:51.440
But...!

06:51.440 --> 06:52.970
Agito!

06:52.970 --> 06:55.410
I'll save Lady Inori...!

07:02.650 --> 07:05.680
After some time had passed,
I went to Shuka's prison...

07:06.750 --> 07:09.690
It can't be... Lady Inori?

07:09.690 --> 07:15.260
Kouran would be spurred to action if they found out both Imperials were alive.

07:15.260 --> 07:19.000
I needed to hide her until the time was ripe.

07:19.000 --> 07:22.270
Kouran is in a state of confusion with the loss of General Kohkaku.

07:22.270 --> 07:24.770
Now is the time to act.

07:24.770 --> 07:27.310
I wasn't aware at all.

07:27.310 --> 07:30.040
Let's fight together from now on.

07:30.040 --> 07:33.310
We will make Inori our king, and free this island.

07:33.310 --> 07:35.650
If that happens, then what of Ibuki...?

07:35.650 --> 07:39.490
It was heart-wrenching deceiving you all.

07:39.490 --> 07:43.320
But this is all for the sake of regaining our country.

07:45.660 --> 07:47.660
I didn't know that...

07:47.660 --> 07:50.830
Agito put that much thought into this?

07:50.830 --> 07:54.370
Lady Inori would like to meet you again at the embassy.

07:54.370 --> 07:56.200
Okay, I'll meet with her.

07:56.200 --> 07:57.340
Wait.

07:57.340 --> 07:58.710
What about Mashiro?

07:58.710 --> 08:00.570
Ibuki, didn't you kill her?

08:02.080 --> 08:03.910
Right...

08:03.910 --> 08:05.910
I killed her...

08:05.910 --> 08:07.320
But...

08:07.320 --> 08:12.490
I was only told of Lady Inori's survival.

08:12.490 --> 08:15.490
You should speak with Mashiro.

08:15.490 --> 08:17.190
By the way, where's Hien?

08:18.730 --> 08:22.700
He died for me...

08:22.700 --> 08:25.390
I see. I'm sure he went honorably...

08:27.030 --> 08:29.740
"Haiga \ D'natia embassy"

08:28.600 --> 08:33.110
Amazing... Ka Grava really built an embassy for us.

08:33.110 --> 08:38.580
It doesn't matter, since it will be in shambles after you use it for a month, Sir Sweallow.

08:38.580 --> 08:43.610
Did you call for me, Your Excellency?

08:45.350 --> 08:50.760
So, Bishop Enumael...
That girl, Inori... Who is she, really?

08:50.760 --> 08:55.630
She is the true Child of Contract, and the true ruler of Nil Kamui.

08:55.630 --> 09:01.440
Our country will protect Lady Inori and help her regain the dynasty she so truly deserves.

09:01.440 --> 09:04.740
In other words, it's going to be ruled by a puppet government?

09:04.740 --> 09:09.380
I would prefer that you acknowledge it as a sister country led by D'natia's grand teachings.

09:09.380 --> 09:11.040
I see...

09:12.550 --> 09:18.090
Speaking of which, could Inori by any chance be a Returned One?

09:18.090 --> 09:20.250
How absurd.

09:23.390 --> 09:27.430
We just fought the walking dead a while ago.

09:27.430 --> 09:31.830
Now we're told that a supposedly dead Imperial has appeared.

09:31.830 --> 09:33.630
Wouldn't you be suspicious, too?

09:33.630 --> 09:38.010
Surely you jest! We're not that foolish.

09:38.010 --> 09:41.440
When Lady Inori came under our protection from the revolutionary army,

09:41.440 --> 09:43.510
we used magic to thoroughly evaluate her background,

09:43.510 --> 09:47.450
along with the possibility of her being a Returned One.

09:47.450 --> 09:54.090
Well, I do believe she is fit to lead the dragon-revering savages.

09:54.090 --> 09:57.590
After all, miracles are adored by the ignorant.

09:57.590 --> 10:01.960
What you're saying can apply to us Black Dragon Knights, too...

10:03.330 --> 10:05.800
"Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

10:04.030 --> 10:08.440
I examined the Yellow Dragon's wedge.

10:08.440 --> 10:11.170
Did it pique your interest?

10:11.170 --> 10:14.940
The magic we use is affected by the magic that dwells within each land,

10:14.940 --> 10:18.210
also known as the country's "State Magic Territory."

10:18.210 --> 10:21.880
You could approach it as a "home" or "away" concept,

10:21.880 --> 10:26.620
but it seems as if this wedge can tilt the balance towards Kouran.

10:26.620 --> 10:31.190
It looks like there's value in working a deal out with you.

10:31.190 --> 10:32.960
Why, of course.

10:32.960 --> 10:35.230
Now then, please do arrange for my artificial arm...

10:35.230 --> 10:36.800
Understood.

10:36.800 --> 10:42.170
Humans are about nothing but using and abusing one another.

10:42.170 --> 10:46.310
Beyond that, all that's left is whether or not they can feel good about it.

10:46.310 --> 10:51.150
Don't you think that's why a trusting relationship holds meaning?

10:51.150 --> 10:53.750
Is this really okay, Lord Ka Grava?

10:53.750 --> 10:57.390
Regardless of D'natia or Kouran, if the wedge is used,

10:57.390 --> 10:59.820
the balance of Nil Kamui's
State Magic Territory will crumble,

10:59.820 --> 11:03.660
and the land will suffer, even with respect to its magic.

11:03.660 --> 11:07.400
That's why we need to nip them in the bud wherever we can.

11:07.400 --> 11:09.100
Lord Ka Grava...

11:09.100 --> 11:14.000
I made a promise to my deceased wife that I would protect your future.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.160
Don't you worry.

11:18.370 --> 11:20.340
"Haiga \ D'natia embassy"

11:27.420 --> 11:30.250
Good work guarding Ibuki.

11:30.250 --> 11:32.520
Leave the rest to us now.

11:38.590 --> 11:40.750
Welcome, dear brother.

11:48.900 --> 11:54.070
Even if you go now, I doubt your thoughts will get through to Ibuki.

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
"State Magic Territory \ Each country's magic

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
only reached its full potential within a certain

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
range around its lands. This range was called

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
the 'State Magic Territory.' For example,

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
a fireball spell that could destroy a whole

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
manor in D'natia would in Nil Kamui only be

11:56.810 --> 12:00.580
strong enough to knock back a single person."

12:04.290 --> 12:08.590
Mashiro offered her life to Ibuki.

12:08.590 --> 12:11.390
Mashiro should be dead, as an equivalence.

12:15.260 --> 12:19.570
Well, I haven't seen Ibuki's power before...

12:19.570 --> 12:20.740
That's why...

12:20.740 --> 12:24.570
That's why there's value in confirming your suspicion.

12:24.570 --> 12:26.730
Isn't that right?

12:27.980 --> 12:30.850
You're the one who built the embassy, right?

12:30.850 --> 12:32.450
Isn't there a way to see inside?

12:32.450 --> 12:35.420
Oh, come now! Even I wouldn't--

12:35.420 --> 12:37.410
I'll set it right up!

12:41.120 --> 12:42.920
I knew it...

12:46.160 --> 12:49.800
Dear brother, you must have gone through a lot.

12:49.800 --> 12:51.490
You too, Inori.

12:52.870 --> 13:00.470
We were born as twins, and according to ancient tradition, I was determined to be king.

13:01.780 --> 13:03.610
That's right.

13:03.610 --> 13:07.340
That's why there's nothing for you to worry about.

13:12.350 --> 13:18.160
But the revolutionary army fought to have Ibuki rule as king.

13:19.730 --> 13:22.200
I can leave you with Mashiro, if you'd like.

13:22.200 --> 13:25.030
Huh? That's not...

13:25.030 --> 13:26.520
Ibuki...

13:33.810 --> 13:36.240
I still can't believe it.

13:36.240 --> 13:39.550
You're really alive, Mashiro...

13:39.550 --> 13:43.080
We're protected by Red Dragon.

13:43.080 --> 13:47.720
Let's all live together forever-- dear brother, Mashiro, and myself.

13:47.720 --> 13:51.930
I'll be the king, and dear brother will help me.

13:51.930 --> 13:54.400
I'm sure we'll make a wonderful country.

13:57.030 --> 13:59.500
"D'natia territory \ Fort Rosweisse"

13:59.870 --> 14:07.370
Our Emperor has ordered us to head to
Haiga to guard Bishop Enumael and Inori.

14:07.370 --> 14:11.850
Were you aware of that girl called Inori, Sir Simeon?

14:11.850 --> 14:14.080
Not at all.

14:14.080 --> 14:18.520
Bishop Enumael will be questioned in regards to her.

14:18.520 --> 14:21.860
But if we depart, our mission of being stationed here...

14:21.860 --> 14:25.860
In regards to that, we have proper support to fill our positions.

14:25.860 --> 14:27.350
Enter.

14:30.460 --> 14:32.230
That emblem...

14:32.230 --> 14:35.600
We are the Emperor's personal order of cavaliers.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.940
We will take position here in Nil Kamui.

14:37.940 --> 14:39.140
Much appreciated.

14:39.140 --> 14:41.910
I will be heading towards Haiga.

14:41.910 --> 14:46.480
I assign Tricolor and Black Tongue to handle the colonial towns towards the rear.

14:46.480 --> 14:50.150
Ruby and Blenheim will head towards Shuka.

14:50.150 --> 14:51.650
Sir!

14:51.650 --> 14:53.290
Let's go, Ulrika.

14:53.290 --> 14:54.780
Sir!

14:57.260 --> 15:00.900
Weren't you going to be the king of this island, Ibuki?

15:00.900 --> 15:02.900
It's all okay now, Eykha.

15:02.900 --> 15:05.260
After all, Mashiro was alive.

15:06.270 --> 15:10.170
...please be a good king...

15:10.170 --> 15:12.000
Mashiro was alive.

15:13.140 --> 15:16.440
I didn't kill her...

15:16.440 --> 15:21.620
Mashiro offered her life for you.

15:21.620 --> 15:27.190
Just because Mashiro was alive doesn't mean your promise to her is gone.

15:27.190 --> 15:30.620
You're going to become the king of this island, Ibuki.

15:30.620 --> 15:32.920
I'm the sword to bring that about.

15:38.600 --> 15:43.840
We received multiple reports from Shuka of
Inori appearing and taking Mashiro with her.

15:43.840 --> 15:46.340
But the details are unknown.

15:46.340 --> 15:49.040
Thank you for your effort.

15:50.180 --> 15:52.310
Mashiro died.

15:52.310 --> 15:54.650
We even made a grave for her.

15:54.650 --> 15:58.950
It's difficult to confirm death, even for an experienced doctor.

15:58.950 --> 16:01.960
There are cases of the dead reviving after their burial.

16:01.960 --> 16:04.860
But her heart was pierced...

16:04.860 --> 16:07.800
Or maybe she's just a stand-in.

16:07.800 --> 16:11.830
It could also be possible that's her long-lost twin.

16:11.830 --> 16:15.400
And as you can see, there's nothing unusual about her.

16:15.400 --> 16:17.500
She's been sitting there the whole time.

16:17.500 --> 16:19.030
The whole time...

16:20.540 --> 16:24.810
She's just sitting there without eating or sleeping...

16:24.810 --> 16:26.680
Isn't Mashiro...

16:26.680 --> 16:28.550
...a Returned One?

16:32.020 --> 16:34.320
If so, Ibuki is in danger.

16:34.320 --> 16:37.560
What are the odds of there being a Returned One possessing sanity?

16:37.560 --> 16:39.050
But Izun was...!

16:43.430 --> 16:47.270
That alone isn't proof of anything.

16:47.270 --> 16:48.840
I understand...

16:48.840 --> 16:52.070
I have to get proof then, right?

16:57.080 --> 16:59.680
I came as Lord Ibuki's messenger.

16:59.680 --> 17:03.680
I have a message for Lady Inori's maid-in-waiting, Mashiro.

17:03.680 --> 17:07.550
No problem. You want to see her somewhere out of view, right?

17:16.930 --> 17:20.370
Do you remember the first time we met?

17:22.600 --> 17:27.410
I promised you that I would protect Ibuki, right?

17:27.410 --> 17:32.710
Mashiro, you and Ibuki didn't throw rocks at Bound Ones like myself.

17:32.710 --> 17:35.820
You both treated me as a normal human.

17:35.820 --> 17:41.990
I'm sure Ibuki will spread such feelings across the island.

17:41.990 --> 17:46.230
I'm bonded to Val, so I don't have many years left to live.

17:46.230 --> 17:50.330
But I've decided I'll use whatever remaining time I have to protect Ibuki.

17:50.330 --> 17:52.130
It's the same for you too, right, Mashiro?

17:52.130 --> 17:57.000
You offered your life to Red Dragon with the wish of having Ibuki become king.

17:57.000 --> 18:00.670
That's why Ibuki kept his promise to you, Mashiro,

18:00.670 --> 18:06.410
and saved the children at the orphanage, at the cost of Kai's life.

18:06.410 --> 18:11.280
It was then I thought that
Ibuki should become king.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.410
Mashiro...?

18:15.790 --> 18:17.090
Ibuki...

18:17.090 --> 18:18.580
Huh?

18:25.130 --> 18:28.360
You don't remember a thing, do you?

18:30.870 --> 18:32.840
I'll protect Ibuki...

18:32.840 --> 18:35.310
I'll protect our king.

18:35.310 --> 18:36.510
So...

18:36.510 --> 18:40.450
So don't smile using my friend's face!

18:44.790 --> 18:48.160
What in the world is this about?!

18:48.160 --> 18:52.660
I can't believe you made me bring this maid-in-waiting here!

18:52.660 --> 18:54.960
I'm terribly sorry about that.

18:54.960 --> 18:56.700
And where would Lady Inori be?

18:56.700 --> 18:58.300
She is still at rest.

18:58.300 --> 19:01.340
I see. Well then, let's get started, shall we?

19:01.340 --> 19:02.670
If you will, Eykha.

19:02.670 --> 19:04.700
Eykha...? What's this about?

19:06.470 --> 19:09.180
Mashiro is... a Returned One.

19:09.180 --> 19:13.510
What's this all of a sudden? Is this supposed to be Nil Kamui's idea of a joke?

19:13.510 --> 19:16.650
Mashiro died once at Shuka.

19:16.650 --> 19:18.250
But she came back to life.

19:18.250 --> 19:22.920
That's what I thought... She was killed by Ibuki, and now she's here in front of us.

19:22.920 --> 19:25.330
Good, my memory isn't fleeting.

19:25.330 --> 19:28.200
Eykha...? But Mashiro is here with us...

19:28.200 --> 19:30.830
True, there are a number of suspect things, but...

19:30.830 --> 19:34.370
It's simply that she was saved by Lady Inori's magic.

19:34.370 --> 19:35.570
I don't see the fuss.

19:35.570 --> 19:39.110
True. In my early years,

19:39.110 --> 19:43.440
I would often think I had killed someone when in fact they were just unconscious.

19:43.440 --> 19:45.410
Turns out that you have to behead them to make sure.

19:45.410 --> 19:47.710
Ah, that's not what we're talking about, Lou...

19:47.710 --> 19:49.920
If you're going to accuse her of being a Returned One,

19:49.920 --> 19:52.690
you should at least show some form of proof.

19:52.690 --> 19:54.280
Eykha?

19:56.690 --> 19:59.250
I killed Mashiro last night.

20:01.200 --> 20:03.460
And your point is?

20:03.460 --> 20:06.970
Mashiro was killed by me last night...

20:06.970 --> 20:10.070
And now, she's come back to life and is in front of us.

20:10.070 --> 20:11.310
That means...

20:11.310 --> 20:13.210
Calm down for a moment, Eykha.

20:13.210 --> 20:14.980
Remove Mashiro's clothes!

20:14.980 --> 20:17.040
Ah, I see...

20:17.040 --> 20:20.950
She should have two scars-- one from when Ibuki killed her,

20:20.950 --> 20:25.620
and another from when
Eykha killed her last night.

20:25.620 --> 20:29.120
That isn't proof of anything!

20:29.120 --> 20:32.160
Moreover, taking her clothes off would be outrageous!

20:32.160 --> 20:35.990
Well, why don't we decide after we take a look at this?

20:51.580 --> 20:53.850
I-Impossible...

20:53.850 --> 20:57.320
It's an image that was recorded by Haiga's security system.

20:57.320 --> 21:01.820
As you can imagine, there is no human who could survive what you just saw.

21:01.820 --> 21:05.630
So, there's only one reason why she would be here in front of us.

21:05.630 --> 21:07.630
It can't be...

21:07.630 --> 21:09.120
Mashiro is...

21:10.700 --> 21:13.870
I don't think I need to explain the dangers of a Returned One.

21:13.870 --> 21:17.670
As the one who oversees Haiga,
I can't let this go unnoticed.

21:17.670 --> 21:19.170
N-No, but...

21:19.170 --> 21:21.510
What's with the commotion, everyone?

21:22.940 --> 21:27.310
Mashiro is indeed a Returned One, but are there any problems with that?

21:27.310 --> 21:28.450
Huh?

21:28.450 --> 21:29.520
Lady Inori?!

21:29.520 --> 21:33.690
Mashiro is a precious person to my dear brother.

21:33.690 --> 21:35.180
That's why...

21:36.720 --> 21:39.060
...I raised her from the dead...

21:42.660 --> 21:44.790
I-Inori...

21:45.970 --> 21:46.400
"Act 8"

21:47.370 --> 21:50.670
"Act 8 \ Perfect Serenity"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.970 --> 23:27.430
"Act 9"

23:27.170 --> 23:33.470
<i>Chaos Dragon</i>, Act 9: "Winding."

23:33.470 --> 23:38.100
The distorted and twisted heart raises the curtain on a stage of tragedy.
